  "limitations": "Illustrative game-design defaults, not tuned by playtesting. Stars rise immediately with heat and fall only through out-of-sight decay or reset events. No separate police, army or helicopter tiers. Line-of-sight is decided by the game runtime (distance within search radius), not here.",
  "port_notes": "Original rules by Skillpack contributors, inspired by the general wanted-level idea of open-world games; no game code or data was copied. stars = number of thresholds reached; on decay stars = min(stars, level(heat)). Decay only counts the part of a tick that lies after the cooldown.",
  "flow_role": "Step 5 (aranma kuralları): fix the rule table and replay a sample chase to confirm stars rise and fall as intended; the rules object goes into the HTML (G012), whose runtime applies the same rules each frame."
